## Translation feature (Android)

The optional on-keyboard translation UI may call public HTTP endpoints
(unofficial Google Translate `client=gtx` and MyMemory as fallback).
This is **not** an official Google Cloud Translation product integration.
Network use is subject to those services' terms and availability; rate limits
or breakage may occur. For production, prefer an official API key of your own.

